                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hollis to Press Censor at Durban, Natal</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Pretoria
                                S. A. R.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-02-02"><hi rendition="#italic">February 2,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Yes; if sent by their friends, and through this consulate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Stanley
                    Hollis.</hi></signed></closer>
